BIB                 11         27
TITLE      Analyzing powers for proton-3He elastic scattering at
           intermediate energies
AUTHOR     (A.Watanabe, K.Sekiguchi, A.Deltuva, K.Hatanaka, T.Ino,
            M.Inoue, S.Ishikawa, M.Itoh, K.Kameya, H.Kanda,
            S.Kitayama, Y.Maeda, Y.Maruta, K.Miki, S.Nakai,
            H.J.Ong, D.Sakai, H.Sakai, Y.Saito, S.Shibuya,
            H.Umetsu, Y.Utsuki, T.Wakasa)
INSTITUTE  (2JPNIPC,2JPNKTO,4LITVLN,2JPNOSA,2JPNKEK,2JPNTOH,
           2JPNHOS,2JPNMZK,3CPRUCA,2JPNKYU)
REFERENCE  (J,PR/C,112,054001,2025)
INC-SOURCE Beam intensity is 3 nA.
           (POLTR)
SAMPLE     - Chemical-form of target is element.
           - Physical-form of target is gas.
           (2-HE-3,ENR=0.99)
FACILITY   (CYCLO,2JPNTOH) Research Center for Accelerator and
                           Radioisotope Science (RARiS)
DETECTOR   (NAICR) NaI(Tl)
           (SCIN) plastic scintillator
ERR-ANALYS (ERR-SYS) The quadratic sum of the uncertainty in the
                     background contamination, the false
                     asymmetry, and the uncertainty in the target
                     polarization.
           (ERR-S) Statistical uncertainty
STATUS     (TABLE,,A.Watanabe+,J,PR/C,112,054001,2025) Fig. 1
HISTORY    (20260527C) Ichiko
           (20260706R) Received by e-mail from Dr. A. Watanabe.
